on | 1 | LOW |\n| Session Management | 1 | LOW |\n\n**Most Critical Issues:**\n1. **Token in localStorage** (line 7, src/api.ts) - Immediately vulnerable to XSS\n2. **Missing CSRF protection** - No tokens or SameSite cookies visible\n3. **Unsanitized error display** - Could expose sensitive information\n\n**Note:** Backend security (SQL injection, authorization, hardcoded secrets) requires separate analysis of the FastAPI backend code in `/backend`. The security posture also depends heavily on backend implementation of authentication, CORS policies, and input validation.\n",
